  "id": 1084,
  "description": "“In silence, we ascend through the ashes of the forgotten.”\n\nBorn from the ruins of lost kingdoms, Velmora is a secretive coven that dwells beneath ancient cathedrals and hollow spires. Cloaked in shadow and guided by whispers of the old gods, its disciples seek transcendence through forbidden rites — trading light for knowledge, and blood for power.\n\nLegends speak of their blackened altars and the echoing hymns that twist through the night air, calling to those who dream of eternity. Few have seen the mark of Velmora and lived to speak of it — for those who enter the veil rarely return unchanged.",
